@startuml F6.1-D02-salvar-config-curso
title F6.1-D02 — Salvar configuração do curso
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Coordenador" as Coord
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CourseController" as Ctrl
participant "UpdateCourseConfigUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Coord -> WebApp: Salvar
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /coordenacao/cursos/{id}/config
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT FOR UPDATE\n+ UPDATE\n+ audit_log (diff)
note right of UC
  sem recalcular
  elegibilidades (CA-05)
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Coord: toast salva

@enduml
